### ============================================================
### STUDENTS API TEST FILE
### ============================================================
### Base URL Variable
### ============================================================
@baseurl = https://erp-9pbn.onrender.com/api/v1
@token = your_token_here

### ============================================================
### STEP 1: LOGIN FIRST TO GET TOKEN
### ============================================================

### Login - POST /auth/login/
POST @baseurl/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rishab@gmail.com",
  "password": "rishu1234"
}

### ============================================================
### COPY auth_token FROM LOGIN RESPONSE AND PASTE ABOVE AS @token
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### STUDENT LIST & DETAIL ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 1. List All Students - GET /students/
GET @baseurl/students/
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. Get Single Student - GET /students/{id}/
GET @baseurl/students/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### STUDENT ACTIONS (Detail Routes)
### ============================================================

### 3. Get Student's Attendance - GET /students/{id}/attendance/
GET @baseurl/students/1/attendance/
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. Get Student's Marks - GET /students/{id}/marks/
GET @baseurl/students/1/marks/
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### TESTING NOTES
### ============================================================
### 1. Run LOGIN request first
### 2. Copy the auth_token value from response
### 3. Replace "your_token_here" with the copied token in @token variable
### 4. Run any other request - it will use the token automatically
### 5. All responses include student data with roll_number, course, class, etc.
### ============================================================
